00:00:32.570 --> 00:00:36.100
All right, so, going
back to the roots--

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:36.980
why are we here?

00:00:36.980 --> 00:00:38.137
What is the goal?

00:00:38.137 --> 00:00:39.970
The goal at the end of
the day-- for Google,

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:42.520
