00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:45.010
We want to take all
these bleeding edge

00:00:45.010 --> 00:00:46.900
innovations in
artificial intelligence

00:00:46.900 --> 00:00:49.000
that our research
teams at Google Brain

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:50.740
are coming up with
and making them

00:00:50.740 --> 00:00:52.840
available to your businesses.

00:00:52.840 --> 00:00:55.960
To make it so that
instead of needing

00:00:55.960 --> 00:00:59.890
