00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:04.720
That's the goal here.

00:01:04.720 --> 00:01:08.252
And with that in
mind, the question

00:01:08.252 --> 00:01:09.460
we have to ask ourselves is--

00:01:12.130 --> 00:01:14.710
given the limited resources
we have-- every organization,

00:01:14.710 --> 00:01:16.940
