00:15:22.390 --> 00:15:23.400
Do some testing.

00:15:23.400 --> 00:15:25.050
Do some remediation.

00:15:25.050 --> 00:15:28.212
Every time a new vendor is
incorporated to your business,

00:15:28.212 --> 00:15:30.420
you have to go through the
programming all over again

00:15:30.420 --> 00:15:32.540
because they have a
completely different logo,

00:15:32.540 --> 00:15:34.060
completely different format.

00:15:34.060 --> 00:15:36.240
So it's a very,
very slow process.

00:15:36.240 --> 00:15:38.310
A very, very
expensive processes.

00:15:38.310 --> 00:15:43.400
And it does not leverage any
benefits of cloud computing

00:15:43.400 --> 00:15:44.520
