have to buy all of it.

00:15:53.670 --> 00:15:55.753
And you have to spend
millions of dollars upfront.

00:15:55.753 --> 00:15:57.695
So that is why we
developed this solution.

00:15:57.695 --> 00:15:59.820
Deloitte has developed
this, prepared this solution

00:15:59.820 --> 00:16:03.940
for automated invoice management
for your S/4HANA ERP system.

00:16:03.940 --> 00:16:08.310
So S/4HANA is SAP's large
enterprise business planning

00:16:08.310 --> 00:16:11.640
