00:17:14.099 --> 00:17:15.300
A lot of money right?

00:17:15.300 --> 00:17:18.060
And you do it most of
the time in a batch mode,

00:17:18.060 --> 00:17:19.410
for most customers.

00:17:19.410 --> 00:17:20.940
And the room for
error is very small

00:17:20.940 --> 00:17:23.970
because you don't want to get
an invoice inaccurately scanned

00:17:23.970 --> 00:17:26.730
which could be for thousands
of dollars to a wrong vendor.

00:17:26.730 --> 00:17:28.410
So there is a lot
of money at stake.

00:17:28.410 --> 00:17:30.240
It's a real business problem.

00:17:30.240 --> 00:17:33.720
So cloud storage helps us
to store all those invoices

00:17:33.720 --> 00:17:37.160
