00:18:40.800 --> 00:18:43.830
So there are essentially
three steps--

00:18:43.830 --> 00:18:46.330
three main steps--
for the solution.

00:18:46.330 --> 00:18:50.190
The step number one is
uploading an invoice.

00:18:50.190 --> 00:18:51.360
It's kind of obvious, right?

00:18:51.360 --> 00:18:54.390
