mobile phone, or any device.

00:19:14.760 --> 00:19:17.550
So all those capabilities
are built in.

00:19:17.550 --> 00:19:20.190
Now, the third important
thing for you to know

00:19:20.190 --> 00:19:24.300
is when you talk about
invoice management,

00:19:24.300 --> 00:19:26.460
you're obviously talking volume.

00:19:26.460 --> 00:19:30.450
So any corporate
customer would have

00:19:30.450 --> 00:19:35.250
