00:21:39.920 --> 00:21:42.500
Now the third
component here is-- now

00:21:42.500 --> 00:21:43.760
we have extracted the invoice.

00:21:43.760 --> 00:21:45.820
We have all the information.

00:21:45.820 --> 00:21:49.920
This information
is posted into SAP.

00:21:49.920 --> 00:21:52.320
And it's not just plain
posting of invoice

00:21:52.320 --> 00:21:53.300
that I'm talking about.

00:21:53.300 --> 00:21:55.400
There are also business
rules, validations,

00:21:55.400 --> 00:21:58.490
and checks that come into
the picture and work close

00:21:58.490 --> 00:22:01.910
to make sure that the data
that is getting uploaded

00:22:01.910 --> 00:22:06.450
is, in fact, accurate
and is business-ready.

00:22:06.450 --> 00:22:08.939
So those are really
the three components

00:22:08.939 --> 00:22:10.730
which come into play
in this whole process.

00:22:13.670 --> 00:22:17.140
So I wanted to get you guys
